# Git LFS — large binary assets.
#
# Scoped to the one file that actually warrants it (13 MB, 93% of nixos/dotfiles/
# by bytes) rather than a blanket *.png rule: the small vendored waybar assets
# under nixos/dotfiles/waybar/.github/ are ~20-130 KB each and gain nothing from
# LFS while adding pointer churn to every diff.
#
# ⚠️  This file is read by Nix as a plain path — nixos/home.nix does
#     `home.file."wallpaper.png".source = ./dotfiles/wallpaper.png`. If the
#     working tree holds an unsmudged LFS pointer (git-lfs not set up, or a
#     GitHub tarball fetch via `github:` rather than a real clone), Nix will
#     happily deploy the 130-byte pointer and the greeter/hyprpaper background
#     silently breaks. See "Git LFS" in README.md.
nixos/dotfiles/wallpaper.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
